    "body": "Can you explain what you main with code?\r\n```js\r\nconst x = new URLSearchParams(\"?q=1&q=2\");\r\nconsole.log(x.getAll(\"q\")); // [\"1\", \"2\"]\r\nx.append(\"y\", \"3\");\r\nx.append(\"y\", \"4\");\r\nconsole.log(x.getAll(\"y\")); // [\"3\", \"4\"]\r\nw(x.toString()); // \"q=1&q=2&y=3&y=4\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
