    "body": "my reading is that there's no way to create that using `URLSearchParams.prototype.set` (or a non-existant `.setAll`). eg:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nlet params = new URLSearchParams() \r\nparams.set(\"q\",[1,2]) \r\nparams.toString() // \"q=1%2C2\"\r\nparams.get(\"q\") // \"1,2\" \r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
