    "body": "`URLSearchParams.prototype.append` looks like the way to go\r\n\r\n```js\r\nlet params = new URLSearchParams()\r\nparams.append(\"q\", 1)\r\nparams.append(\"q\", 2)\r\nparams.toString() // \"q=1&q=2\"\r\nparams.getAll(\"q\") // [ \"1\", \"2\" ]\r\n```\r\n",
